<title>CANADA: Canada's Prairies to see rain, normal to warm high.</title>
<headline>Canada's Prairies to see rain, normal to warm high.</headline>
<dateline>WINNIPEG 1996-09-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Canada's Prairies Thursday were forecast to see rain and average to warm highs, Environment Canada said.</p>
<p>Alberta should see showers and highs of 10 to 15 Celsius.</p>
<p>Saskatchewan should see showers and highs of 13 to 21 C.</p>
<p>Manitoba should see showers and highs of 20 to 30 C.</p>
<p>--Gilbert Le Gras</p>
</text>
